window.products.push({"id":425027,"name":"BALIBETOV [New Yerba Mate Wood Gourd Set - Traditional Palo Santo and Aluminum (Mate Cup) with Bombilla (Yerba Mate Straw) (Wood With Aluminum Base)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YcV9hbjSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE ARGENTINA SET - Balibetov Wood Gourd Mate set includes: A Palo Santo wood Yerba Mate cup wrapped in aluminum, a Bombilla straw, a cleaning brush and a beautiful serving spoon. MEASUREMENTS: Being handmade natural product sizes are not exact. Yerba Mate gourd Contains approximately 5 oz I 150ml. Please Please read the included manual with clear instructions before any use for a long lasting product. ABOUT THE PALO SANTO WOOD - The most valued wooden container to serve Yerba Mate. Its pleasant resin like aroma remains in the container through the serving providing an exquisite taste to the beverage. Palo Santo is a very fragile wood and must be cured and maintained to prevent it from cracking. All temperature changes must be done gradually since the Palo Santo wood does not support sudden temperature changes. With a proper maintenance process you will enjoy it for years to come. SET BENEFITS - A traditional completely Natural Handmade in Argentina Product! The Palo Santo is not susceptible to fungi and does not absorb any aromas. It can therefore be used to serve both clean and aromatic Yerba Mate infusions. The fragrant wood contributes to the flavor, especially when used over time. Mate cup and bombilla included. Great gift to any Mate lover! RICH HISTORY & KNOWN-BENEFITS: The Gourd is the traditional method used by millions around the world to enjoy Yerba Mate tea. A Beverage rich in antioxidants and nutrients that can naturally boost your energy and improve your mental focus. As it is said to offer, “the strength of coffee, the health benefits of tea, and the euphoria of chocolate\". SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - If for any reason you are unsatisfied or have any issue with the product, being a complete natural gourd it is very fragile and can get damaged during the shipping process, please contact us and give us the chance to rectify the problem. We assume complete responsibility for all our shipments and are determined to provide total satisfaction to our valued customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YcV9hbjSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALIBETOV","source_asin":"B07RNFH62Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-425027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RNFH62Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RNFH62Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
