window.products.push({"id":425053,"name":"Twist Alea Limone Salad Plate Set of 6 by Villeroy & Boch - Premium Porcelain - Dishwasher and Microwave Safe - 8.25 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4110SS54GXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Refreshing and light, the Twist Alea Limone pattern from Villeroy & Boch cheers up any occasion. Multi-colored mosaic squares combine in geometric rows encircling rims and serving areas, while a four-dot design in tangerine orange adds a whimsical quality. Softer washes of color offset the bold mosaic pattern, while a sponge-like effect tempers the bands of rich yellow and green found around the rims and edges. Mix and match Twist Alea Limone pieces with Twist Alea Caro and Twist Alea Verde to create a truly unique collection. About Us: Based in Germany, Villeroy & Boch is one of the largest producers of premium porcelain and ceramic products worldwide. Family-owned since 1748, Villeroy & Boch is an award-winning, innovative company rooted in a time-honored tradition. Over its 250+ year history Villeroy & Boch has become known as a trusted international lifestyle brand offering tabletop and sophisticated home décor products for your contemporary lifestyle. For generations, our dinnerware has graced the tables of crowned European royalty, and has been a staple in renowned hotels and restaurants on every continent. Amazon.com Refreshing and light, the Twist Alea Limone pattern from Villeroy & Boch cheers up any occasion. Multi-colored mosaic squares combine in geometric rows encircling rims and serving areas, while a four-dot design in tangerine orange adds a whimsical quality. Softer washes of color offset the bold mosaic pattern, while a sponge-like effect tempers the bands of rich yellow and green found around the rims and edges. Mix and match Twist Alea Limone pieces with Twist Alea Caro and Twist Alea Verde to create a truly unique collection. A multi-colored mosaic design frames the crisp, white serving area of each 8-1/4-inch salad plate in this set of six. Sponge-like effects soften the saturated colors, while a pale yellow rim decorated with a tangerine orange, four-dot pattern and a band of green subtly accents the edge of each dish. Crafted from vitrified porcelain to ensure durability, all Villeroy & Boch tableware pieces are resilient enough to be placed in the dishwasher and microwave. For added beauty, a top glaze has been applied to protect the vivid colors. --Lea Werbel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4110SS54GXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B0797M1KYB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-425053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0797M1KYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0797M1KYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
