window.products.push({"id":425278,"name":"Cosy House Collection Luxury Down Alternative Comforter - Blend of Rayon Derived from Bamboo - Bedroom Essentials - All Season Use - Box Stitch Constr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VDcbYzq7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ULTRA SOFT & COMFORTABLE – This Luxury Down Alternative Comforter has a fluffy polyester microfiber fill that resembles the cuddly-softness of traditional feather down, and is made from a smoother-than-silk 40% Rayon derived from Bamboo, 60% Microfiber blend. Soft, supple, and plush, our comforter is lightweight yet thick enough to keep you warm and cozy. It's time for buttery-smooth, super-comfy bedding to cuddle up with! Our silky soft Cream Full/Queen sized comforter measures at: 88\" x 88\" BREATHABLE & COOLING - You'll never sleep hot again! Say goodbye to night sweats. Our fabric’s breathable and moisture-wicking properties help regulate excess body heat. Carefully crafted for all-night-long skin-caressing comfort, our luxurious temperature-regulating blend stays cool during the summer and is perfect for all-season use. Try pairing this luxe comforter with our Luxury Duvet Cover for extra warmth during cold winter nights! MADE TO LAST- Snuggle up with a comforter made to last for years to come. Our signature baffle-box stitching pattern isn't only elegant, but it also keeps the fill secure, preventing it from shifting or clumping over time. Indulge in a restful sleeping experience all night long. Kind to your skin, super strong and very durable, AND with more than five colors to choose from, your slumber will be a blissful 5-star resort experience. No matter what kind of sleeper you are, we've got you covered! BETTER SLEEP & SKIN - The natural properties of our fabric make this bedding safe for sensitive skin, keeping you and your bed feeling fresh each and every day. EASY CARE - Our comforter is machine washable (on gentle cycle with cold water) and dryer safe (tumble dry on low heat). No need for ironing or bleaching! This comforter is made to last. Our Luxury Comforter provides shrink, odor, fade, and stain resistance, and will fight against wear and tear wash after wash. PLUS, it repels common non-living household allergens! Compared to traditional cotton bedding, our comforter stays fresher for longer and is oh-so-easy to care for. STAYS IN PLACE - Our stay-in-place design uses Premium Corner-Tie Loops to secure duvet covers into place, preventing your comforter from shifting around and bunching up while you sleep. One of the softest bedspreads out there for your mattress, our Full/Queen comforter will grant you peace of mind so you can sleep peacefully. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Shop with confidence! If you don't absolutely love your Luxury Down Alternative Comforter, we offer a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee paired with world-class customer service. Simply contact us with any questions or concerns, and we’ll get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VDcbYzq7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cosy House Collection","source_asin":"B07KL16YZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-425278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KL16YZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KL16YZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
