window.products.push({"id":425316,"name":"DIDADI 83 Ft-24 Pack Artificial Fake Hanging Plant Leaves Foliage Green Leaves Garden Wall Decoration Ivy Vine Plants for Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oyiKXpQyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Artificial ivy is a stylish,low-maintenance decoration for any nature-inspired space. It’s a versatile and eye-catching artificial plant that can also be used to enhance beautiful flower bouquets and vase arrangements. Artificial leaf vine,with leaves hanging down to offer extra cover and a great naturalistic look. discover the benefits of artificial ivy today.br> Features: Material: Leaves were made from silk and the stems were made from plastic, high quality. Length: each strand 6.9ft long,12pack total 83ft long,80 leaves per strand. Size: approx. 2.1m each, big leaf size: approx 1.9x1.9 inch (4.6x4.6cm),small leaf size:approx. 1.5x1.5 inch (3.6x3.6cm) This ivy garland will never die off, and easy take care of it. so that it can be a nice decoration for a long time. Can be used for wedding, party, garden, home,kitchen, office, shopping malls, easy to install and disassemble. Decoration Ideas: High quality fake ivy has a realistic look and texture. With the ability to cut the stems and leaves to suit your needs, they are a perfect addition to any floral bouquet or as a way to bring nature indoors. Stay on top of the trend by using fake ivy to form the base of a “green wall’ inside your home, office or cafe. Ivy is also the perfect product to create hanging baskets, frame a window or as a complement to flowers in wedding or other special occasion. Use artificial ivy as an accompaniment in any floral arrangement. It creates structure and enhances the vibrancy of your bouquet when used in combination with artificial leaves and branches. Package Contents: 12 * Artificial Ivy Leaf Garland Plants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oyiKXpQyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Didadi","source_asin":"B075GL3C96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-425316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075GL3C96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075GL3C96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
