window.products.push({"id":425488,"name":"Urban Legacy Accent Floating Shelves | Reclaimed Wide Plank Barn Wood with Floating Brackets | Set of 2 (Natural, 18\" x 7\" x 2\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":103.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TAVd6OtiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 2 Urban Legacy Accent Floating Shelves and Flush Mount Floating Brackets. The shelves are Natural barn wood, unfinished and unstained. Color may vary (please see all pictures). Each shelf measures 18” long x 7” deep x 2\" thick (nominal measurements). Each shelf weighs approximately 3 lbs and can support up to 10 additional lbs. Please be sure to look at all the available pictures to see the different variations of distressing and coloration that may occur. Every nail, nail hole, paint mark, divot, scrape and scratch are evidence of the decades of life this wood has experienced in the barns. We do not add to or take away from the naturally occurring beauty of the wood used to make these shelves. Distressing and color will vary depending on where the wood was used in the barns. The pictures in this listing represent some, but not all, of the natural variations in color and distressing. As this is solid reclaimed wood, please handle with care to avoid any small splinters. Handmade by Amish Artisans from genuine reclaimed barn wood in Lancaster County, PA. Available in Natural (unfinished, unstained, color varies), Coffee Bean, and White Washed. Mounting into studs is recommended, but not required. Drywall anchors are included Weight capacities not including weight of shelf: 18” shelves - 10 lbs per shelf, 24” shelves - 12 lbs per shelf, 30” shelves - 15 lbs per shelf, 36” shelves - 18 lbs per shelf, 40” shelves - 20 lbs per shelf, 48” shelves - 23 lbs per shelf. Important Note: Natural (no stain) shelves are not stained or finished in any way. All coloring is naturally occurring from decades in working barns. When the shelves are cut to size, the ends may be lighter or a different color, as they have not been previously exposed the elements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TAVd6OtiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Legacy","source_asin":"B07DPSSJFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-425488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DPSSJFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DPSSJFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
