window.products.push({"id":425756,"name":"Airtight Food Storage Containers with Lids, CASA LINGO Large Pantry Organization and Storage for Bulk Food Dry Food Cereal, Set of 5 Plastic Food Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kdFvAu7eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉CASA LINGO food storage containers are perfect for organize your kitchen and pantry：With the stackable design, these different size plastic storage containers will make more efficient use of every inch of your home kitchen. Make your kitchen or pantry neatly organized and beautiful. Whether you have a large or small pantry, these durable containers will help you organize your kitchen and pantry better. 👉New safety seal design: The square box design makes the whole more stable and not easy to be knocked over, and the top of the lid is provided with a groove, so that when stacked together, the upper and lower storage boxes are as stable as a whole. Leakproof 4-hinge locking system forms an airtight, watertight seal between container and lid, which can always keep your food dry and fresh. 👉New lock design: The new lock design avoids breaking as easily as the traditional design, which extends the service life of the storage containers. All the size have the same lids make it easy to identify and combine. So you don’t have to worry about not being able to find a cover of the corresponding size 👉4 sizes fulfill all your storage needs: Includes 1 Tall Container(10pound suger/5.2 liters), 1 Large Containers (6.5pound suger/3.3 liters), 2 Medium Containers (5pound suger/2.6 liters) , 1 small Containers (3.5pound suger/1.8 liters). These kitchen storage containers are perfect for many kinds of dry food and baking supplies, such as flour, sugar, rice, grain, chips, cereals, nuts, beans, snacks, pasta, coffee and tea. Plus wide enough openings to reach in with measuring cup. 👉Durable high quality & 100% BPA free: CASA LINGO food storage containers made of durable high quality 100% food safe BPA free plastic. Come with 1 Measuring cup with handle, chalkboard Labels and 1 chalkboard pen. Let us enjoy a kitchen or pantry neatly organized and beautiful!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kdFvAu7eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASA LINGO","source_asin":"B0BF1Q41Y8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-425756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF1Q41Y8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF1Q41Y8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
